      "Frame 26: robot_1 moves farther image-left along wall_shelving_unit_1 and raises the white bundle to approximately chest height. Both elbows are elevated, and the grippers hold the material just in front of an upper-middle shelf opening. towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, and towel_4 remain visually inseparable within the bundle. The robot is now immediately in front of the shelving, with its hands approximately at shelf-contact distance. folded_linen_stack_1 is near the left-side placement region, while folded_linen_stack_2 and folded_linen_stack_3 remain in adjacent shelving areas; exact stack boundaries are partly obscured. folding_table_1 is clear in the foreground, and laundry_cart_1 stands roughly one to two meters to the robot's right. orange_storage_cabinet_1, wall_mounted_hose_1, black_storage_rack_1 and folded_linen_stack_4, metal_storage_rack_1 and folded_linen_stack_5, and laundry_cart_2 remain stationary. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 remain unresolved. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 are several meters away on the right. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 stay illuminated.",
      "Frame 27: robot_1 extends both arms into the left portion of wall_shelving_unit_1. The carried white material is now against or supported by a horizontal shelf, and the grippers remain around its outer edges. towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, and towel_4 are not individually separable, but their tracked bundle has reached the shelf surface. The robot's torso is close to the shelf front, with arms nearly horizontal. The bundle overlaps the visible region associated with folded_linen_stack_1; folded_linen_stack_2 and folded_linen_stack_3 remain elsewhere on the shelving. folding_table_1 remains largely empty, and laundry_cart_1 is approximately one to two meters image-right. orange_storage_cabinet_1 and wall_mounted_hose_1 remain behind-right. black_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_4, metal_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_5, and laundry_cart_2 show no change. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 remain individually unidentifiable. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 remain stationary across the room. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 remain on.",
      "Frame 28: robot_1 draws its forearms back slightly from wall_shelving_unit_1 while still facing left. A compact white folded grouping remains on the shelf, and the grippers hover just in front of it. Individual towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, and towel_4 are not visible as distinct pieces; the carried grouping is now shelf-supported. The robot remains within arm's reach of folded_linen_stack_1 and the nearby shelf surface. folded_linen_stack_2 and folded_linen_stack_3 remain stationary in adjacent portions of the shelving. folding_table_1 stays clear in the foreground, and laundry_cart_1 remains roughly one to two meters image-right. orange_storage_cabinet_1, wall_mounted_hose_1, black_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_4, metal_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_5, and laundry_cart_2 remain unchanged. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 cannot be independently distinguished among the background supplies. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 remain several meters from the robot on the right. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 remain illuminated.",
      "Frame 29: robot_1 leans slightly toward wall_shelving_unit_1 again and extends its image-left arm toward the newly shelf-supported white grouping. Its other gripper stays closer to its torso, and the visible fabric remains on the horizontal shelf rather than hanging freely. towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, and towel_4 remain individually unresolved within that grouping. The robot is at direct reaching distance from folded_linen_stack_1 and the shelf front; folded_linen_stack_2 and folded_linen_stack_3 remain unchanged nearby. folding_table_1 is largely empty. laundry_cart_1 is roughly one to two meters to the robot's right, while laundry_cart_2 is farther toward the rear-right. orange_storage_cabinet_1, wall_mounted_hose_1, black_storage_rack_1 and folded_linen_stack_4, and metal_storage_rack_1 and folded_linen_stack_5 are stationary. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 remain too small and ambiguous to identify individually. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 remain unchanged. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 stay on.",
      "Frame 30: robot_1 retracts both grippers from wall_shelving_unit_1, holding them raised in front of its chest. The compact white material remains resting on the shelf. towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, and towel_4 cannot be distinguished individually, but no portion of their tracked bundle is visibly suspended between the robot and the shelf. The robot is still close to the shelving, within approximately half a meter at the torso, and begins orienting slightly away from it. folded_linen_stack_1 occupies the nearby shelf region; folded_linen_stack_2 and folded_linen_stack_3 remain stationary elsewhere on the unit. folding_table_1 remains clear, and laundry_cart_1 stands roughly one to two meters image-right. orange_storage_cabinet_1, wall_mounted_hose_1, black_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_4, metal_storage_rack_1 with folded_linen_stack_5, and laundry_cart_2 remain unchanged. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 are unresolved. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 remain distant on the right. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 remain illuminated.",
