      "Frame 19: robot_01 leans closer to table_01 and places both grippers against opposing regions of server_01's edges. Its forearms are nearly level with the chassis, and its head is bowed toward the hand contact area. server_01 is still approximately horizontal at tabletop height; a clear airborne gap is not yet visible. cable_01 remains coiled at the back-right of table_01. server_02 stays flat on table_02 across the aisle. rack_01, cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain unchanged. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 are partially hidden behind the robot and white table. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain at far right. shelf_01 retains computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 retains computer_11\u2013computer_17, and neither shelving unit moves. monitor_01 and monitor_02 remain dark; cabinet_01 remains fixed.",
