      "Frame 24: robot_arm_1 retreats to the left and opens robot_gripper_1, creating a clear gap beside the charger. robot_arm_2 keeps robot_gripper_2 vertical immediately above battery_charger_1. Three closely spaced silver-and-dark battery forms, battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3, are now visible projecting upward from the charger region, although the right fingers obscure some of their tops. The right gripper remains at or very near contact distance; the left gripper is several finger-lengths away. orange_storage_bin_1 remains untouched on the right. charger_power_cable_1, work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 retain their positions. robot_cable_1 shifts left with the withdrawn arm, while robot_cable_2 remains central. background_workbench_1 and its red_storage_bin_1, blue_storage_bin_1, and blue_storage_bin_2 remain unchanged.",
