      "Frame 31: Lid_1 has lowered substantially and now covers almost the entire opening of box_1. A narrow wedge-shaped gap remains along the near edge, through which only small portions of the contents are visible; the individual states of flask_1, flask_2, flask_3, and insert_1 are mostly obscured. Robot_arm_2's downward-pointing fingers are immediately above the lid's left/back area. Robot_arm_1's open fingers are close to the right end of the lid and box. Box_1 remains in the same position on table_1. Cables_1 and equipment_1 remain behind the arms.",
