      "Frame 31: robotic_arm_1 raises its wrist away from the closed bread_box_1, increasing the gap between its downward-facing fingers and the lid. The fingers appear separated, with no visible object between them. robotic_arm_2 holds its upright, right-folded pose near the box's right edge. bread_piece_1 remains out of view. robot_support_pedestal_1 and robot_support_pedestal_2 remain stationary. countertop_1, sink_1, faucet_1, and mug_1 are unchanged. cutting_board_1 holds tomato_1, tomato_2, and tomato_3; bottle_1 remains upright behind it. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1, with oven_1 closed below. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1 through lower_cabinet_5, window_1, and window_2 remain unchanged. The first arm's withdrawal creates a clear air gap above the lid, while neither arm approaches the produce or stove.",
