      "Frame 26: robot_arm_2_right lowers its upper assembly slightly while keeping its main links nearly vertical, bringing its partly hidden wrist closer to counter height near serving_bowl_1. robot_arm_1_left remains bent over the bowl from the left. The grippers occupy adjacent parts of the bowl region, well left of the green produce. yellow_produce_item_1 and purple_onion_1 remain out of separate view; cutting_board_1_center remains exposed to the right. robot_pedestal_1_left and robot_pedestal_2_right do not move. green_produce_item_1_left, green_produce_item_2_middle, and green_produce_item_3_right remain on cutting_board_2_right. bottle_1_near_sink, bottle_2_beside_utensil_holder, utensil_holder_1, and bottle_3_near_stove are upright and stationary. cooking_pot_1, gas_cooktop_1, closed oven_1, sink_1, faucet_1, stemmed_glass_1, and countertop_1 are unchanged. lower_cabinet_1_left, lower_cabinet_2_center_left, lower_cabinet_3_center, lower_cabinet_4_beside_oven, upper_cabinet_1, and window_1 remain static.",
