      "Frame 5: Robotic_arm_1 begins drawing its wrist leftward from cutting_board_1 while maintaining a low, extended posture. Its end assembly rotates slightly and is now adjacent to the saucepan_1 handle area, with exact finger contact obscured. The board-to-gripper gap increases slightly; yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, and yellow_food_piece_3 remain in place, as does plate_1. Saucepan_1 remains immediately right of cooktop_1. Stove_control_knob_1 stays below the forearm, and robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. Countertop_1 and the backsplash arrangement of bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are unchanged. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain stationary. No opening is visible in cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 or drawer_1\u2013drawer_8; some fronts remain obscured.",
      "Frame 6: Robotic_arm_1 retracts farther left and bends at its middle joints, bringing the wrist over the space between saucepan_1 and cooktop_1. The gripper is approximately 40\u201355 image pixels left of the yellow-food cluster, increasing its separation from cutting_board_1. Saucepan_1 is partly hidden beneath the wrist and forearm, preventing confirmation of the grip or exact support state. Stove_control_knob_1 remains below and left of the wrist; robot_pedestal_1 is motionless. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 stay unchanged. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain fixed. Sink_1 is empty-looking and faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible state change.",
      "Frame 7: Robotic_arm_1 continues folding leftward, with its wrist passing over the right side of cooktop_1. The gripper and saucepan_1 region overlap heavily; the pot's exact position and any grasp are partly occluded. The end assembly is now approximately 65\u201380 image pixels left of cutting_board_1's food cluster and much closer to the cooking area than to the board. Stove_control_knob_1 is directly below this region. Robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain stationary. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 stay along the unchanged countertop_1. Sink_1 and inactive faucet_1 are unchanged, as are refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain shut where visible.",
      "Frame 8: Robotic_arm_1 folds into a more upright arch, moving the wrist left and slightly upward over cooktop_1. Saucepan_1 is substantially obscured behind the end assembly and links; a small light handle-like section is visible near the cooking area. The gripper is above stove_control_knob_1 with only a few tens of image pixels of separation. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain roughly 90\u2013110 pixels farther right. Robot_pedestal_1 does not move. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 retain their positions. Sink_1 remains empty-looking and faucet_1 has no visible stream. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed or partly hidden.",
      "Frame 9: Robotic_arm_1 makes a smaller inward adjustment, keeping its wrist over the front portion of cooktop_1 while its upper links form a compact bend. Saucepan_1 remains hidden in large part by the arm, so its exact pose cannot be established from this frame alone. The gripper stays close above stove_control_knob_1, without clearly visible knob contact. Robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged, well to the right of the end effector. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, wooden_utensil_2, and countertop_1 are stationary. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 retain their previous visible states.",
      "Frame 10: Robotic_arm_1 rotates its wrist inward and slightly raises the end assembly, exposing more of the narrow gripper beside cooktop_1. The arm remains compact over robot_pedestal_1 rather than reaching toward cutting_board_1. Saucepan_1 is still largely occluded in the cooking area. Stove_control_knob_1 remains below the wrist, separated by several tens of image pixels. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain stationary on and behind the board. Bottle_1 and bottle_2 remain beside utensil_holder_1 with wooden_utensil_1 and wooden_utensil_2; bottle_3 remains near sink_1. Countertop_1 is unchanged and faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain fixed. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible opening.",
      "Frame 11: Robotic_arm_1 turns its end assembly farther inward, with the gripper angled diagonally downward near the center-left cooking region. The upper arm is more vertical, and the wrist is farther left than in the extended frames. Saucepan_1 remains difficult to distinguish behind the arm; cooktop_1 is partly visible around it. Stove_control_knob_1 is below and slightly right of the gripper. Robot_pedestal_1 stays fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged, approximately a hundred image pixels to the right. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain stationary. Sink_1 is empty-looking; faucet_1 is inactive. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no state change.",
      "Frame 12: Robotic_arm_1 pivots its upper links toward a more upright alignment, while a slim section of the gripper points downward in front of the cooking area. The gripper approaches the vertical level of stove_control_knob_1, although a definite connection is not visible. Saucepan_1 is concealed behind the arm; cooktop_1 remains fixed in countertop_1. Robot_pedestal_1 is stationary. The end effector remains far left of cutting_board_1, and yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 have not moved. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain upright. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no water movement. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed where visible.",
      "Frame 13: Robotic_arm_1 continues rotating its wrist and upper links, bringing the wrist higher and slightly right while the gripper swings around the left side of the end assembly. Robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. The arm obscures most of saucepan_1 and part of cooktop_1; no reliable pot orientation can be read. Stove_control_knob_1 stays below and right of the wrist, with no clear contact. Cutting_board_1 remains separated from the robot by roughly a forearm-length in the image. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are stationary. Sink_1, inactive faucet_1, refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain shut or partly occluded.",
      "Frame 14: Robotic_arm_1 rotates into a diagonal folded pose, with its end assembly crossing in front of the cooking area and the gripper visible toward the left of the wrist. The distance from the gripper to cutting_board_1 remains large, while it stays within a few tens of image pixels of cooktop_1. Saucepan_1 is mostly hidden by overlapping robot links. Stove_control_knob_1 and robot_pedestal_1 remain stationary. Yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3 and plate_1 retain their positions. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain along the backsplash above unchanged countertop_1. Sink_1 remains empty-looking beneath inactive faucet_1. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are fixed. No opening or displacement is visible in cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 or drawer_1\u2013drawer_8.",
      "Frame 15: Robotic_arm_1 folds more tightly, lowering the wrist slightly and carrying the gripper toward the left side of its upper links. Its end assembly is now nearer the robot's own centerline than the cutting board. Saucepan_1 and part of cooktop_1 remain occluded; stove_control_knob_1 is still visible to the right of the folded arm. Robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 show no movement. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain stationary. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed where visible, with additional left-center occlusion from the folded arm.",
      "Frame 16: Robotic_arm_1 makes a modest adjustment within the compact folded pose; its wrist and gripper remain left of the gray stove fascia and near countertop height. The arm is close to cooktop_1 in projection, but saucepan_1 remains largely blocked by the links. Stove_control_knob_1 is several tens of image pixels right of the gripper. Robot_pedestal_1 is stationary. Cutting_board_1 remains well beyond the gripper to the right; yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, wooden_utensil_2, and countertop_1 retain their arrangement. Sink_1 remains empty-looking and faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible change.",
      "Frame 17: Robotic_arm_1 holds a tightly bent configuration with a small wrist rotation; the upper links overlap strongly, and the gripper is partly hidden on the left side of the assembly. Robot_pedestal_1 remains fixed. Saucepan_1 is obscured around cooktop_1, while stove_control_knob_1 remains visible just right of the arm. No knob contact can be confirmed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain stationary and much farther right than the wrist. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are unchanged. Sink_1 and inactive faucet_1 remain in place. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed where visible; some fronts are hidden behind the robot.",
      "Frame 18: Robotic_arm_1 makes another slight inward rotation while maintaining the same compact posture above robot_pedestal_1. The end assembly remains close to the left cooking area and substantially left of cutting_board_1. Saucepan_1 is still mostly hidden by the arm; cooktop_1 and stove_control_knob_1 remain fixed, with the knob offset to the wrist's right. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 show no movement. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain upright on countertop_1 near the backsplash. Sink_1 is empty-looking and faucet_1 has no visible flow. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 retain their appearance. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain shut or partly cropped and occluded.",
      "Frame 19: Robotic_arm_1 slightly raises and rotates its folded wrist assembly, exposing a little more of the upper joint while keeping the gripper close to the cooking region. Robot_pedestal_1 remains stationary. Saucepan_1 remains difficult to see behind the robot; cooktop_1 is partly visible around the links. Stove_control_knob_1 remains a few tens of image pixels to the right and below the wrist. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 show no displacement. Sink_1 and faucet_1 remain inactive. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible state change.",
      "Frame 20: Robotic_arm_1 is nearly unchanged from the preceding frame, holding a compact angled pose with the end effector partly concealed by overlapping links. Robot_pedestal_1 is fixed. The wrist remains near cooktop_1 and left of stove_control_knob_1; saucepan_1 is largely occluded, so its support state is not directly visible. Cutting_board_1 is well to the right of the robot, and yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 retain their positions. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, wooden_utensil_2, and countertop_1 remain stationary. Sink_1 remains empty-looking beneath inactive faucet_1. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed wherever visible.",
      "Frame 21: Robotic_arm_1 starts to unfold upward, lifting its upper joint and rotating the wrist so the gripper begins emerging beside the cooking area. The arm's silhouette becomes taller, while robot_pedestal_1 stays fixed. Saucepan_1 is still mostly blocked, and cooktop_1 remains beneath the end assembly. Stove_control_knob_1 is below and right of the wrist. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged and separated from the robot by roughly a hundred image pixels. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are stationary. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no flow or disturbance. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, cup_1, cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4, and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 retain their visible states.",
      "Frame 22: Robotic_arm_1 rises into a more vertical arch and lowers its visible gripper toward the front edge of countertop_1. Saucepan_1 is now clearly visible resting on cooktop_1, with its light brown handle extending left. The gripper is below the pot and immediately left of stove_control_knob_1, within roughly 10\u201325 image pixels in projection; exact contact is unclear. Robot_pedestal_1 remains stationary. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 retain their backsplash positions. Sink_1 is empty-looking and faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain fixed. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed where visible.",
      "Frame 23: Robotic_arm_1 holds its upper section upright while moving the gripper slightly lower and closer to stove_control_knob_1. The finger area is immediately left and below the knob, at approximately one gripper-width separation or less in projection, though the image does not establish a secure grasp. Saucepan_1 stays on cooktop_1 with its handle leftward. Robot_pedestal_1 and countertop_1 remain fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged and far to the right of the gripper. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain upright. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain visibly closed or partly occluded.",
      "Frame 24: Robotic_arm_1 rotates its wrist beside stove_control_knob_1, bringing the circular wrist joint into clearer view near the gray fascia. The gripper overlaps the knob area in projection, but neither exact finger placement nor a change in knob angle is reliably visible. Saucepan_1 remains centered on cooktop_1 with its handle pointing left. Robot_pedestal_1 is fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 retain their positions on countertop_1. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are unchanged. Sink_1 remains empty-looking and faucet_1 has no visible water stream. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible opening.",
      "Frame 25: Robotic_arm_1 bends forward and downward, lowering the wrist beneath stove_control_knob_1 while its upper links lean toward the fascia. The end assembly is below countertop height, roughly 20\u201340 image pixels beneath the knob, with a narrow gripper section extending upward toward the panel. Definite knob motion is not visible. Saucepan_1 remains on cooktop_1, and robot_pedestal_1 stays fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain stationary. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain fixed. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed, with more of the left-center fronts obscured by the lowered arm.",
      "Frame 26: Robotic_arm_1 folds farther down and forward, placing the wrist below the gray stove fascia while the upper link arches above it. The gripper lies close beneath stove_control_knob_1, but the panel and robot overlap enough to obscure contact. Saucepan_1 remains stationary on cooktop_1, its leftward handle visible behind the arm. Robot_pedestal_1 is fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain well to the right without movement. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are unchanged. Sink_1 remains empty-looking and faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no change from their closed or partly occluded states.",
      "Frame 27: Robotic_arm_1 maintains the low folded posture with only a small joint adjustment. The wrist remains beneath stove_control_knob_1 and close to the counter-front fascia, while the gripper is partly hidden between the arm and panel. No definite knob rotation is discernible. Saucepan_1 stays on cooktop_1 with its handle to the left; robot_pedestal_1 and countertop_1 remain fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged and distant from the end effector. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain upright. Sink_1 and inactive faucet_1 remain unchanged. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain visibly shut where not obscured.",
      "Frame 28: Robotic_arm_1 leans marginally farther forward, bringing the upper wrist-side link closer to the gray fascia while keeping the end assembly low. The gripper remains immediately beneath or partly behind stove_control_knob_1 in projection; exact contact is unresolved. Saucepan_1 is unchanged on cooktop_1. Robot_pedestal_1 remains stationary, and the arm is still far left of cutting_board_1. Yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 retain their positions. Countertop_1, bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 show no movement. Sink_1 remains empty-looking and faucet_1 has no visible flow. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are fixed. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed or partially hidden.",
      "Frame 29: Robotic_arm_1 makes a slight inward/downward adjustment while remaining folded against the counter-front region. Its wrist stays beneath stove_control_knob_1, with the gripper largely occluded by the arm and fascia. There is no clear change in the knob's appearance. Saucepan_1 remains resting on cooktop_1 with the handle leftward. Robot_pedestal_1 is fixed. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged on countertop_1. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 are stationary. Sink_1 and faucet_1 show no activity. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain shut wherever visible, with the arm blocking some left-center fronts.",
      "Frame 30: Robotic_arm_1 holds almost the same low folded configuration, with a minor shift of the upper link and wrist near the underside of the stove fascia. Stove_control_knob_1 remains above the partially hidden gripper; contact and angular movement are not reliably visible. Saucepan_1 remains on cooktop_1, and robot_pedestal_1 stays fixed. The gripper is substantially left of cutting_board_1 and below countertop_1. Yellow_food_piece_1\u2013yellow_food_piece_3 and plate_1 remain stationary. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 retain their positions. Sink_1 remains empty-looking beneath inactive faucet_1. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are unchanged. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed where visible.",
      "Frame 31: Robotic_arm_1 makes a pronounced downward and leftward fold, moving its upper links away from the counter fascia and bringing the wrist close to the top of robot_pedestal_1. The end assembly is now clearly below stove_control_knob_1, separated by several tens of image pixels, and no contact is visible. Saucepan_1 remains unobstructed on cooktop_1 with its handle pointing left. Countertop_1, cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 are unchanged. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 remain fixed. Sink_1 is empty-looking and faucet_1 has no visible flow. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 remain stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 remain closed or partly obscured.",
      "Frame 32: Robotic_arm_1 settles slightly lower into its compact folded pose over robot_pedestal_1, with the wrist and gripper near the mounting plate and below countertop_1. No held object is clearly visible. Stove_control_knob_1 is above and slightly right of the end assembly, approximately 30\u201345 image pixels away, with no visible contact. Saucepan_1 remains on cooktop_1 and its light brown handle extends left. Cutting_board_1, yellow_food_piece_1, yellow_food_piece_2, yellow_food_piece_3, and plate_1 remain unchanged. Bottle_1, bottle_2, bottle_3, utensil_holder_1, wooden_utensil_1, and wooden_utensil_2 stay in their backsplash positions. Sink_1 remains empty-looking; faucet_1 is off. Refrigerator_1, window_1, wall_shelf_1, and cup_1 are stationary. Cabinet_door_1\u2013cabinet_door_4 and drawer_1\u2013drawer_8 show no visible opening, with some fronts obscured or cropped."
