      "Frame 3: quadruped_robot_01 takes another short forward-right step, reducing its distance to storage_cabinet_01 to less than roughly one body length. Its front end is now near the outer edge of storage_cabinet_shelf_01. robotic_arm_01 remains mostly horizontal above the body, and robot_gripper_01 is empty, left of and above grocery_carton_01 rather than in contact with it. The carton remains upright; storage_cabinet_door_01 remains closed across the main opening. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, and drawer_unit_01 remain closed on the left. countertop_01 still contains sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 beneath window_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, soap_dispenser_02, and closed drawer_unit_02 are unchanged at the rear. oven_01 remains closed beneath stovetop_01, and cooking_pot_01 remains on the cooktop. range_hood_01 is stationary above. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain unchanged. countertop_03 remains clear and unused in the right foreground.",
