      "Frame 5: quadruped_robot_01 maintains approximately the same position and stance in front of storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 rises into a tall bent configuration, with its upper joint near the cabinet's countertop height and its distal segment angled downward toward the cabinet front. robot_gripper_01 moves rightward and downward, approaching the door area above and left of grocery_carton_01. The carton remains upright on storage_cabinet_shelf_01, and storage_cabinet_door_01 remains closed. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are unchanged on the left. countertop_02 still supports sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02; stovetop_01 still supports cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain stationary overhead. countertop_03 remains empty in the right foreground. The robot's arm is now much closer to the cabinet than to any other fixture.",
      "Frame 6: quadruped_robot_01 remains stationary while robotic_arm_01 bends farther toward storage_cabinet_door_01. robot_gripper_01 is near the central-right area of the cabinet front, slightly above and left of grocery_carton_01; the arm-to-door gap is very small, though the exact contact point is difficult to distinguish. storage_cabinet_01 remains visually closed, with storage_cabinet_shelf_01 protruding and the carton upright on it. refrigerator_01 remains closed at the far left. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged. under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 stay closed. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02, and drawer_unit_02 remains closed below. oven_01 is closed beneath stovetop_01; cooking_pot_01 remains stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed. countertop_03 remains clear, and the robot does not approach it.",
      "Frame 7: quadruped_robot_01 holds its position near storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 remains raised and bent, with robot_gripper_01 at the cabinet front. A narrow dark vertical gap has appeared along the right side of storage_cabinet_door_01, indicating that the panel has begun shifting leftward. grocery_carton_01 remains upright and unmoved on the right side of storage_cabinet_shelf_01. The gripper is near the door rather than around the carton. refrigerator_01 remains closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain on countertop_01 beneath window_01; under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 remain closed. countertop_02, sponge_01, soap_dispenser_02, and closed drawer_unit_02 are unchanged. oven_01 remains closed, with stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 stationary above it. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 is clear and separated from the robot by open floor.",
      "Frame 8: storage_cabinet_door_01 has moved farther left, exposing a dark rectangular opening on the right side of storage_cabinet_01. quadruped_robot_01 stays in place with its body facing the opening. robotic_arm_01 and robot_gripper_01 shift leftward with respect to the cabinet; the gripper remains empty and separate from grocery_carton_01. The carton stands upright on the projecting storage_cabinet_shelf_01 at the lower part of the opening. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01 still holds sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 below window_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, and soap_dispenser_02 remain unchanged beside the opening. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 are unchanged overhead. countertop_03 remains clear in the foreground. The cabinet opening is the only substantial environmental change.",
      "Frame 9: storage_cabinet_door_01 is displaced farther left, leaving most of the right-hand bay of storage_cabinet_01 exposed. quadruped_robot_01 remains close to the projecting storage_cabinet_shelf_01. robotic_arm_01 extends diagonally left, and robot_gripper_01 sits near the left portion of the cabinet front, well left of grocery_carton_01. The carton remains upright on the shelf without visible movement. refrigerator_01 is closed; countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain stationary on the left. under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 remain closed. countertop_02, sponge_01, soap_dispenser_02, and closed drawer_unit_02 remain unchanged to the right of the storage cabinet. oven_01 remains closed beneath stovetop_01, and cooking_pot_01 remains in place. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain overhead. countertop_03 is clear. The robot is still separated from all fixtures other than the cabinet-front region.",
