      "Frame 11: quadruped_robot_01 begins a small forward adjustment toward the open storage_cabinet_01, changing its leg positions while keeping its body aligned with the bay. robotic_arm_01 stays raised, and robot_gripper_01 remains open near the upper-left portion of the opening. The gap from the robot's front end to storage_cabinet_shelf_01 is slightly smaller. grocery_carton_01 remains upright on the shelf; storage_cabinet_door_01 stays leftward and open. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged. under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 remain closed. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 above closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains closed, and stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains empty and outside the robot's immediate reach.",
      "Frame 12: quadruped_robot_01 has moved a little farther forward, placing its front end close to the outer edge of storage_cabinet_shelf_01. Its legs settle into a more compact stance in front of storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 remains upright, with robot_gripper_01 open near the exposed bay and above grocery_carton_01. The carton remains upright and stationary; storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open to the left. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01 continues to hold sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 beneath window_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, and soap_dispenser_02 are unchanged. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary below range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed on the rear wall. countertop_03 stays clear. The robot's arm is now positioned directly in front of the cabinet opening rather than well to its left.",
      "Frame 13: quadruped_robot_01 remains planted immediately in front of storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 rotates its distal section upward and right, bringing robot_gripper_01 higher and closer to a position above grocery_carton_01. The gripper is open and empty, with a visible vertical gap above the carton. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains leftward, and the dark bay stays exposed above storage_cabinet_shelf_01. The carton is still upright on the shelf. refrigerator_01 remains closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain on countertop_01 beneath window_01, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed below. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 beside closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains shut beneath stovetop_01 and stationary cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain unchanged overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. No other kitchen object moves.",
      "Frame 14: robotic_arm_01 forms a higher arch over the front of quadruped_robot_01 and extends into the opening of storage_cabinet_01. robot_gripper_01 rotates downward, approaching grocery_carton_01 from above. The gripper is now almost directly over the carton, with a much smaller gap than before, while the robot's feet and body remain nearly fixed. grocery_carton_01 remains upright on storage_cabinet_shelf_01, and storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open to the left. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are unchanged. countertop_02 still supports sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary beneath range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 stay fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear and is not contacted.",
      "Frame 15: quadruped_robot_01 stays steady in front of the open storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 lowers its distal section, bringing robot_gripper_01 to the upper sides of grocery_carton_01. The yellow fingers visually flank or overlap the carton near its top; contact appears to begin, although the exact finger surfaces are partly obscured. The carton remains upright at shelf height on storage_cabinet_shelf_01. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains displaced left. refrigerator_01 is closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed below. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 above closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains shut; stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain unchanged overhead. countertop_03 is clear. The carton and gripper are now at effectively zero visible separation.",
      "Frame 16: robotic_arm_01 makes a small upward and inward adjustment while robot_gripper_01 remains closely wrapped around the upper portion of grocery_carton_01. The carton is still approximately vertical and close to storage_cabinet_shelf_01, with little clearance beneath it yet visible. quadruped_robot_01 maintains its stance immediately before storage_cabinet_01. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open, exposing the dark interior behind the carton. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain stationary on countertop_01 under window_01. countertop_02 still supports sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02, while stovetop_01 supports cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01 remains fixed above the cooking area. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain unchanged on the upper wall. countertop_03 remains clear in the foreground. No other object moves or contacts the robot.",
      "Frame 17: grocery_carton_01 is visibly lifted above storage_cabinet_shelf_01, remaining approximately upright between the fingers of robot_gripper_01. robotic_arm_01 extends in a broad arch from quadruped_robot_01 toward storage_cabinet_01, holding the carton in front of the open bay. A clear gap has developed beneath the carton. The robot's body and feet remain essentially stationary. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains displaced left. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged; under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 stay closed. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 beside closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains closed beneath stovetop_01, and cooking_pot_01 remains stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains empty. The only displaced loose object is the carton held by the robot.",
      "Frame 18: quadruped_robot_01 holds its position while robotic_arm_01 makes a small adjustment at the open storage_cabinet_01. robot_gripper_01 continues to hold grocery_carton_01 above storage_cabinet_shelf_01; the carton remains upright and appears slightly lower than in the previous frame but is still off the shelf. The gripper and carton stay near the front of the exposed bay. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains leftward. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01 still contains sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 beneath window_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, and soap_dispenser_02 remain stationary at the rear. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain unchanged below range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear and separated from the robot. The arm remains the only visibly moving robot component.",
      "Frame 19: robotic_arm_01 swings its distal section farther right and into the dark opening of storage_cabinet_01. robot_gripper_01 carries grocery_carton_01 with it, moving the carton away from the projecting outer edge of storage_cabinet_shelf_01 and deeper into the bay. The carton is partly overlapped by the gripper and appears slightly tilted during this movement. quadruped_robot_01 makes only a minor stance adjustment. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open to the left. refrigerator_01 is closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 above closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains closed; stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed. countertop_03 remains clear. The carton is now closer to the cabinet interior than to the robot's body.",
      "Frame 20: quadruped_robot_01 remains close to storage_cabinet_01 while robotic_arm_01 bends downward into the exposed bay. robot_gripper_01 and grocery_carton_01 descend toward storage_cabinet_shelf_01 at a position farther inside than the carton's original location. The carton is partly obscured by the fingers and dark interior, with its lower portion near shelf height. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains displaced left. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are stationary. countertop_02 still holds sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02. stovetop_01 still supports cooking_pot_01, with no visible steam or flame. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. The robot does not contact the neighboring oven, drawers, or countertops.",
      "Frame 21: robotic_arm_01 remains extended into storage_cabinet_01, and robot_gripper_01 holds close around grocery_carton_01 near the interior surface of storage_cabinet_shelf_01. There is very little visible motion relative to the preceding frame. The carton is mostly upright but partly hidden by the gripper, making exact shelf contact difficult to distinguish. quadruped_robot_01 maintains a planted stance in front of the bay. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open to the left. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged above closed under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, soap_dispenser_02, and closed drawer_unit_02 are unchanged. oven_01 remains shut beneath stovetop_01 and stationary cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. All movement is confined to small arm or gripper adjustments.",
      "Frame 22: quadruped_robot_01 continues holding its position immediately before storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 maintains a downward-reaching bend into the opening, and robot_gripper_01 remains around or immediately beside the upper part of grocery_carton_01. The carton is close to the inner portion of storage_cabinet_shelf_01, with little visible clearance underneath. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open and leftward. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain on countertop_01 beneath window_01. countertop_02 still carries sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary beneath range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain unchanged. countertop_03 stays clear in the right foreground. The robot remains substantially farther from the sink, refrigerator, and right counter than from the cabinet opening.",
      "Frame 23: robot_gripper_01 opens above grocery_carton_01 inside storage_cabinet_01. The carton now appears upright and supported on storage_cabinet_shelf_01 farther back from its projecting front edge. robotic_arm_01 remains extended into the bay, with the fingers separating from the carton's upper portion. quadruped_robot_01 stays planted, and storage_cabinet_door_01 remains displaced left. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged; under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 remain shut. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 beside closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains closed, stovetop_01 remains unchanged, and cooking_pot_01 stays on its burner. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. The carton is no longer visibly suspended from the gripper.",
      "Frame 24: robotic_arm_01 begins withdrawing from storage_cabinet_01, moving robot_gripper_01 leftward and slightly upward away from grocery_carton_01. The empty gripper is visibly separated from the carton, which remains upright on the inner part of storage_cabinet_shelf_01. quadruped_robot_01 remains close to the cabinet with its feet planted. storage_cabinet_door_01 stays open to the left, leaving the carton visible against the dark interior. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01 still contains sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 beneath window_01. countertop_02, sponge_01, and soap_dispenser_02 remain stationary. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 are unchanged beneath range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains empty. The distance between gripper and carton increases while the carton itself does not visibly move.",
      "Frame 25: robotic_arm_01 folds back toward quadruped_robot_01, bringing robot_gripper_01 out of the cabinet opening and closer to the robot's upper body. The gripper is empty. grocery_carton_01 remains upright farther inside storage_cabinet_01 on storage_cabinet_shelf_01, clearly separated from the withdrawing arm. storage_cabinet_door_01 remains open to the left. The robot's body remains close to the shelf, with only a small stance change. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are unchanged above closed under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 above closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 is closed beneath stovetop_01, and cooking_pot_01 remains stationary. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. No other loose object changes position.",
      "Frame 26: quadruped_robot_01 begins moving slightly backward from storage_cabinet_01, increasing the gap between its front end and the projecting storage_cabinet_shelf_01. Its leg positions change, while robotic_arm_01 stays partially folded above the body. robot_gripper_01 remains empty and outside the bay. grocery_carton_01 remains upright on the shelf inside the open cabinet; storage_cabinet_door_01 remains leftward. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged. countertop_02 still supports sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02, while stovetop_01 supports cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01 remains stationary above the oven. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed on the rear wall. countertop_03 remains clear. The robot-to-carton distance increases because the robot retreats, not because the carton moves.",
      "Frame 27: quadruped_robot_01 takes a more visible backward-left step, shifting its body away from storage_cabinet_01 while keeping its front directed toward it. The feet spread into a new stance, and the gap to storage_cabinet_shelf_01 increases. robotic_arm_01 is bent upright over the front of the body; robot_gripper_01 remains empty. grocery_carton_01 remains upright inside the open cabinet, and storage_cabinet_door_01 stays displaced left. refrigerator_01 remains closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain on countertop_01 beneath window_01, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed below. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 beside closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains shut beneath stovetop_01 and stationary cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. The robot is still nearest to the storage cabinet despite stepping back.",
      "Frame 28: quadruped_robot_01 pauses in its slightly withdrawn position. robotic_arm_01 rotates leftward, extending robot_gripper_01 toward the left-side position of storage_cabinet_door_01. The empty gripper is near the cabinet front rather than near grocery_carton_01, which remains upright deeper on storage_cabinet_shelf_01. storage_cabinet_01 is still open on the right. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain stationary. countertop_02 continues to hold sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain unchanged beneath range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear in the right foreground. The robot's body is farther from the cabinet than during carton handling, but its extended arm keeps the gripper close to the door panel.",
      "Frame 29: robotic_arm_01 lowers and rotates robot_gripper_01 into the left portion of the cabinet-front area, near storage_cabinet_door_01. The gripper appears very close to the door surface, although its precise contact is partly obscured by the arm. quadruped_robot_01 remains planted in front of storage_cabinet_01. The right bay remains open, and grocery_carton_01 is still visible upright on storage_cabinet_shelf_01. refrigerator_01 remains closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are unchanged, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed below. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 above closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains closed beneath stovetop_01, and cooking_pot_01 stays in place. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain stationary overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. There is no renewed contact between the gripper and carton.",
      "Frame 30: storage_cabinet_door_01 has shifted rightward across the opening of storage_cabinet_01, narrowing the exposed dark bay. quadruped_robot_01 holds its stance while robotic_arm_01 and robot_gripper_01 remain close to the moving panel. grocery_carton_01 is still visible through the remaining opening on the right, upright on storage_cabinet_shelf_01, but increasingly obscured by the door. The projecting shelf itself remains stationary. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 remain unchanged. countertop_02 still holds sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02. stovetop_01 and cooking_pot_01 remain stationary beneath range_hood_01. wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear. Only the cabinet panel and nearby robot arm show appreciable change.",
      "Frame 31: storage_cabinet_door_01 now covers the opening of storage_cabinet_01. grocery_carton_01 is no longer visible because the door occludes the interior position where it was last seen. storage_cabinet_shelf_01 continues to project outward below the door area, with no carton on its exposed portion. quadruped_robot_01 remains close and stationary. robotic_arm_01 is bent upright, and robot_gripper_01 is near the middle-right region of the closed door, with no object held. refrigerator_01 remains closed. sink_01, faucet_01, and soap_dispenser_01 remain on countertop_01 beneath window_01, with under_sink_cabinet_01 and drawer_unit_01 closed. countertop_02 retains sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02 beside closed drawer_unit_02. oven_01 remains shut beneath stovetop_01 and stationary cooking_pot_01. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain fixed overhead. countertop_03 remains clear and uncontacted.",
      "Frame 32: quadruped_robot_01 holds its final four-footed stance in front of storage_cabinet_01. robotic_arm_01 makes only a small settling adjustment into a compact upright bend, with robot_gripper_01 low near the closed storage_cabinet_door_01 and visibly holding nothing. storage_cabinet_shelf_01 remains extended, and grocery_carton_01 remains hidden behind the door rather than visible on the exposed shelf. The gripper is close to the cabinet face, while the robot's body remains a short distance back. refrigerator_01, under_sink_cabinet_01, drawer_unit_01, drawer_unit_02, and oven_01 remain closed. countertop_01, sink_01, faucet_01, soap_dispenser_01, and window_01 are unchanged. countertop_02 still supports sponge_01 and soap_dispenser_02; stovetop_01 still supports cooking_pot_01 without visible steam or flame. range_hood_01, wall_shelf_01, wall_shelf_02, wall_shelf_03, and cup_01 remain stationary overhead. countertop_03 remains clear in the right foreground. The camera viewpoint and the rest of the kitchen remain unchanged."
