      "Frame 28: object_01 reaches its deepest crouched, forward-leaning posture in this sequence. Both arms are extended toward object_05, which is now visibly supported by the wire shelf of object_04. The grippers begin opening or separating from the rim, although they remain close to the box. object_07 remains contained and is difficult to distinguish through the translucent wall. The robot's chest is close to the shelf front, and its head angles downward. object_37 hangs in curved loops behind the torso before trailing left. object_28 remains to the box's left, object_30 to its right, object_29 and object_31 above, and object_32 below. objects_33\u201336 remain undisturbed on top. object_02, object_03, object_24, object_25, and object_27 remain stationary in the foreground. object_06, objects_08\u201323, and object_26 are cropped or obscured. objects_38\u201342 are not clearly visible. The clear box does not move with the initial hand withdrawal.",
