      "Frame 30: object_01 steps backward away from object_04 with its elbows bent and empty grippers held in front of the abdomen. The separation between the robot and object_05 increases to approximately half a step or more. The box remains level and stationary on the shelf between object_28 and object_30; object_07 remains inside but is visually indistinct. object_37 stretches behind and toward the left as the robot retreats. object_29, object_31, object_32, and top-shelf objects_33\u201336 retain their positions. object_02 occupies the lower-right foreground, carrying unchanged object_03, object_24, object_25, and object_27; the other bench items object_06, objects_08\u201323, and object_26 are mostly cropped. objects_38\u201340 are not visible clearly, and objects_41\u201342 remain off-screen. The robot's head remains directed toward the shelving while its feet move away from it.",
      "Frame 31: object_01 continues backing into the open tiled area, now roughly one step from object_04. Its knees are slightly bent during the stride, its torso remains oriented toward the shelves, and both empty grippers are held close together in front of the waist. object_37 trails diagonally toward the left edge. object_05 remains on the shelf with object_07 inside, though the drill is not separately clear at this distance. object_28 is immediately to the box's left and object_30 farther right; object_29 and object_31 stay above, object_32 below, and objects_33\u201336 along the top. The foreground object_02 shows object_03, object_24, object_25, and object_27 without displacement. object_06, objects_08\u201323, and object_26 are outside the crop or obscured. objects_38\u201340 are not clearly visible, and objects_41\u201342 remain off-screen. The robot is no longer within direct hand contact of any shelf object.",
      "Frame 32: object_01 stands or finishes a small settling step on the open floor left of object_04, viewed mostly from behind. Its elbows remain bent, both grippers are empty at waist level, and its head points toward the shelving. The robot is approximately one step from object_05 and is not touching any object. object_37 trails toward the left; objects_41\u201342 are outside the frame. object_05 remains stationary on the shelf between object_28 and object_30. Its contents, including object_07, are not separately clear through the translucent walls in this frame. object_29 remains upper-left, object_31 upper-right, object_32 below, and objects_33\u201336 on the top shelf. object_02 occupies the lower-right foreground with object_03, object_24, object_25, and object_27 visible and stationary. object_06, objects_08\u201323, and object_26 are cropped or obscured, so their current fine details cannot be inspected. objects_38\u201340 are likewise not clearly visible. There is a clear open-floor gap between the robot and the shelf, and no visible carried object."
