      "Frame 9: humanoid_robot_1 remains on both knees and shifts its upper body diagonally toward image left. Its head tilts with the torso, one hand is held near the abdomen, and the other is slightly farther outward at lower-chest height. Both knees remain in contact with polished_floor_1, while the feet stay folded behind. robot_beanie_1 remains fixed; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang off-center. The gap to living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, stair_handrail_1, and the stair-side person remains substantial. reception_counter_1 is clearly visible at image right, with backpack_1 leaning at its base and orchid_arrangement_1 displaying white flowers above it. Seated people continue watching from that area. The chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 cluster is largely outside the left crop, as are much of standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 and display_screen_1. Remaining support_column_1\u2013support_column_4 sections, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 do not move. Individual labels across person_1\u2013person_15 cannot be confidently matched.",
