      "Frame 11: humanoid_robot_1 remains kneeling on both knees, with its torso slightly tilted and its head directed generally toward the camera. One hand is held near the front of the pelvis and the other slightly higher and farther to the side. Neither hand contacts polished_floor_1; both knees do. robot_beanie_1 is unchanged, and robot_lanyard_1 with robot_identification_badge_1 remains suspended over the torso. living_plant_wall_1 forms the rear background, and staircase_1 with stair_handrail_1 remains behind the robot's image-right side. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 retain their positions near the seated observers. Their separation from the robot appears essentially unchanged. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 are mostly outside the current crop; standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 and display_screen_1 are not individually clear. Visible parts of support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain stationary. Background pedestrian movement is visible, but person_1\u2013person_15 cannot all be uniquely assigned or continuously tracked.",
      "Frame 12: humanoid_robot_1 straightens its torso somewhat while retaining contact through both knees. Its head becomes more upright, and its hands move closer to the center of the waist. The folded lower legs remain behind the knees on or close to polished_floor_1. robot_beanie_1 stays in place; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 settle closer to a vertical hang as the torso straightens. The robot does not visibly reduce its horizontal separation from living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, stair_handrail_1, or the person at the stairs. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, orchid_arrangement_1, and seated reception-side people remain across the open floor to the right. The chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 area remains largely cropped, while standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 and display_screen_1 are unresolved. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain static where visible. A distant person crosses the left background; the full set person_1\u2013person_15 is not individually identifiable.",
      "Frame 13: humanoid_robot_1 raises its upper body into a taller kneeling posture, with the chest and head more vertically aligned above the pelvis. Both knees still touch polished_floor_1, while its feet remain folded behind. The hands hover together near the upper pelvis with elbows bent. robot_beanie_1 remains fitted to the head; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang more centrally. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 retain their background positions, and the stair-side person remains well behind the robot. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, orchid_arrangement_1, and seated observers are unchanged at right. No furniture or person is within touching distance. chair_1\u2013chair_8, table_1\u2013table_4, standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2, and display_screen_1 remain mostly cropped or too distant to distinguish separately. The visible support_column_1\u2013support_column_4 structures, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 are static. Some of person_1\u2013person_15 are visible, but their exact identities and total count cannot be recovered in this framing.",
      "Frame 14: humanoid_robot_1 lowers its hips slightly within the kneeling posture and brings both forearms forward. Its hands are now held farther in front of the pelvis, approximately level with one another. Both knees remain down on polished_floor_1, with feet tucked backward. robot_beanie_1 stays stable; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 remain centered but shift slightly with the torso. The robot's horizontal distances to living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, stair_handrail_1, and the stair-side person remain broadly unchanged. reception_counter_1, backpack_1 at its base, orchid_arrangement_1 above, and seated people beside it remain stationary. The chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 seating zone remains largely beyond the left crop. standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 and display_screen_1 are not clearly resolved; support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain fixed where visible. No member of the partially visible person_1\u2013person_15 group interacts physically with the robot.",
      "Frame 15: humanoid_robot_1 changes from two-knee kneeling to an asymmetric stance. The leg on image right swings forward and outward, planting its black foot on polished_floor_1, while the knee on image left stays down with its lower leg folded backward. The torso rises slightly and both hands extend forward above the pelvis. One knee and the opposite foot now provide the visible floor contacts. robot_beanie_1 remains in place; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang forward between the arms. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, stair_handrail_1, and the nearby standing person remain several meters behind. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, orchid_arrangement_1, and reception-side seated people remain at right without contact. chair_1\u2013chair_8, table_1\u2013table_4, standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2, and display_screen_1 remain mostly outside the crop. Visible support_column_1\u2013support_column_4 portions, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 are unchanged. person_1\u2013person_15 cannot all be uniquely distinguished.",
