      "Frame 22: humanoid_robot_1 has returned to a two-footed low squat. Both black feet contact polished_floor_1, both knees bend outward, and neither knee touches the surface. Its torso leans slightly forward, with both hands lowered in front of the knees. robot_beanie_1 stays on the head; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang between the forearms. The robot makes a small lateral displacement while remaining in the open floor area. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain behind, several meters away. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, orchid_arrangement_1, and the seated reception-side people are now more tightly cropped at right. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 occupy more of the left background, with standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 nearby. display_screen_1 is not yet clearly resolved. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 are increasingly prominent. Visible members of person_1\u2013person_15 remain behind the robot.",
      "Frame 23: humanoid_robot_1 stays low with bent, widely spaced knees and its hands hanging forward below the waist. Its feet make a small repositioning movement, changing the width and angle of the stance without bringing the knees back to polished_floor_1. The torso remains slightly tilted. robot_beanie_1 remains secure; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 sway in front of the abdomen. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain in the background, with the standing phone-looking person near the steps. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, orchid_arrangement_1, and seated observers are at or beyond the right crop. More of chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 is visible at left, though individual numbering remains uncertain. standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 are pale background panels; display_screen_1 is indistinct. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain fixed as the camera reframes. No member of person_1\u2013person_15 approaches within contact distance.",
