      "Frame 4: Robotic arm_2 carries white clothes hanger_1 noticeably lower and farther left, bringing its triangular body over the shoulders and upper chest of green T-shirt_1. The hanger rotates toward a more front-facing orientation, with its hook near the upper middle of the image. Its right corner remains held by the right gripper. Robotic arm_1 stays close to the shirt\u2019s upper-left edge. Bed_1 supports the largely flat shirt on brown comforter_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains exposed at right, while striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain stationary beyond the shirt.",
      "Frame 5: White clothes hanger_1 is now centered over the upper chest of green T-shirt_1, with its bottom bar nearly horizontal and its hook pointing upward. Robotic arm_2 holds the hanger\u2019s right side close to the shirt\u2019s right shoulder, while robotic arm_1 is near the hanger\u2019s left end and the shirt\u2019s left neckline. The visible gap between hanger and shirt has become small, although exact contact is unclear. Brown comforter_1 remains beneath the shirt on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 show no visible movement.",
      "Frame 6: Robotic arm_2 lowers and shifts white clothes hanger_1 slightly left across green T-shirt_1. The hanger\u2019s lower bar lies across the upper-chest region above the printed graphic, and its left end approaches robotic arm_1\u2019s gripper. Robotic arm_1 remains immediately beside the left shoulder and collar area. The shirt\u2019s neckline begins to appear less evenly spread, while the torso and hem stay flat on brown comforter_1. Bed_1 and the right-side light-colored bedsheet_1 are unchanged. Striped pillow_1 and gray pillow_1 remain at the head, with pile of clothing_1 still to their left.",
      "Frame 7: Robotic arm_2 advances farther inward, bringing its gripper and the right corner of white clothes hanger_1 over green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper-right chest. The hanger\u2019s bottom bar remains almost horizontal, while the hook shifts left toward the centerline of the shirt. Robotic arm_1 is close to the hanger\u2019s left side and the shirt\u2019s left shoulder. The upper fabric develops slight localized wrinkles; the lower shirt stays on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains exposed on the right. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain fixed in the background.",
      "Frame 8: Robotic arm_2 moves inward and slightly downward, with its gripper now over the upper-center/right portion of green T-shirt_1. White clothes hanger_1 shifts left and tilts, its hook approaching robotic arm_1 and its lower bar crossing the upper chest. The shirt\u2019s collar region becomes more gathered between the closely spaced grippers. Robotic arm_1 maintains a near-contact position at the left shoulder. The graphic remains visible below the working area on brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 retain their arrangement.",
      "Frame 9: Robotic arm_2 angles farther toward the shirt\u2019s center, holding white clothes hanger_1 low against or immediately above the upper chest of green T-shirt_1. The hanger is diagonal, with its hook at the upper-left and its right corner partly obscured by the right gripper. Robotic arm_1 stays beside the left collar region. The shirt\u2019s upper edge is increasingly uneven, with a small fold beneath the left gripper, while its lower portion stays spread over brown comforter_1 on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains at right; striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain undisturbed.",
      "Frame 10: Robotic arm_1 shifts slightly left and upward while remaining closely associated with green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper-left fabric. Robotic arm_2 maintains a low position over the upper-right chest, and white clothes hanger_1 lies diagonally between the grippers with its hook visible above the left collar area. The upper-left fabric lifts into a shallow ridge, while the printed torso remains against brown comforter_1. Bed_1 and light-colored bedsheet_1 show no change. Striped pillow_1 and gray pillow_1 stay at the head of the bed, and pile of clothing_1 remains behind the left arm\u2019s working area.",
      "Frame 11: Robotic arm_1 withdraws slightly farther left, and the upper-left portion of green T-shirt_1 rises and wrinkles near its gripper. Robotic arm_2 remains close to the hanger\u2019s right side over the upper chest. White clothes hanger_1 is still diagonal, with its hook above the shirt\u2019s left neckline and its lower bar partly visible across the chest. The shirt\u2019s main body remains flat on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 stays exposed along the right. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain stationary and separated from the end effectors.",
      "Frame 12: Robotic arm_1 moves farther outward to the left and slightly upward, drawing the nearby upper-left fabric of green T-shirt_1 into a more pronounced raised fold. Robotic arm_2 holds position close to the upper-right chest. White clothes hanger_1 remains between the arms, with its hook upright toward the upper-left and its right side near the right gripper. The neckline is no longer flat, though the graphic and lower torso still rest on brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain unchanged.",
      "Frame 13: Robotic arm_1 lifts its end effector a little farther above the left shoulder of green T-shirt_1; the fabric beneath it forms a raised, irregular fold. Robotic arm_2 continues to hover or press closely at the shirt\u2019s upper-right chest beside white clothes hanger_1. The hanger\u2019s hook and left sloping edge are clearly exposed above the bunched neckline, while its lower section remains close to the shirt. Brown comforter_1 supports the shirt\u2019s flat lower body on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains on the right, and striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 stay still.",
      "Frame 14: Robotic arm_1 shifts slightly inward again, bringing its gripper nearer the raised left neckline of green T-shirt_1. Robotic arm_2 remains low over the right upper chest, maintaining close spacing with white clothes hanger_1. The hanger stays diagonally positioned, hook above the shirt and bottom bar partially visible across the green fabric. The shirt\u2019s upper-left section remains elevated and wrinkled, while the torso rests on brown comforter_1. Bed_1 and light-colored bedsheet_1 remain fixed. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 show no interaction with either arm.",
      "Frame 15: Robotic arm_1 makes a small inward adjustment at green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper-left edge, keeping its gripper in contact with or immediately adjacent to the gathered fabric. Robotic arm_2 maintains its position beside white clothes hanger_1\u2019s right section. The hanger remains low over the upper chest, its hook above the collar and its left slope bordering the raised fabric. The printed lower portion of the shirt stays broadly flat on brown comforter_1. Bed_1, right-side light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain in their previous positions.",
      "Frame 16: Robotic arm_1 remains close to the left neckline of green T-shirt_1 while robotic arm_2 begins a slight rightward adjustment. White clothes hanger_1 shifts minimally, with its hook still above the left side of the collar and its lower bar visible near the top of the printed design. The gathered upper fabric changes shape slightly around the grippers but remains raised above the flatter torso. Brown comforter_1 continues to support the shirt on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains exposed on the right; striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain stationary.",
      "Frame 17: Robotic arm_2 moves rightward and slightly upward, increasing its separation from robotic arm_1. White clothes hanger_1 becomes more exposed across green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper chest, with its hook toward the upper-left and its broad lower bar extending right. Robotic arm_1 remains at the shirt\u2019s left collar area, where the fabric is visibly bunched. The right shoulder remains spread on brown comforter_1 while the neckline is raised. Bed_1 and light-colored bedsheet_1 are unchanged. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain beyond the immediate arm movements.",
      "Frame 18: Robotic arm_2 lifts and retreats toward the upper-right, leaving a visible gap between its gripper and white clothes hanger_1. The hanger now rests across or immediately against green T-shirt_1 without visible support from the right gripper; its complete triangular outline is more exposed, with the hook toward the upper-left. Robotic arm_1 remains close to the gathered left neckline. The shirt\u2019s right sleeve and lower torso stay on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains along the right edge. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain unmoved.",
      "Frame 19: Robotic arm_2 arcs back left and downward from its raised position, approaching the upper-right shoulder and neckline of green T-shirt_1. Its gripper is above the hanger\u2019s right sloping section rather than directly at the far-right corner. White clothes hanger_1 remains diagonally spread across the shirt, and robotic arm_1 stays beside the gathered upper-left fabric. The torso and printed graphic remain visible on brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 retain their positions, with no visible contact from the robot.",
      "Frame 20: Robotic arm_2 lowers its gripper toward the upper-right neckline area of green T-shirt_1, close to white clothes hanger_1\u2019s sloping right side. Robotic arm_1 continues holding or closely contacting the raised fabric on the opposite side. The hanger lies low over the chest, its hook upright at the upper-left and its right corner resting near the shirt\u2019s center-right. The shirt\u2019s upper region is wrinkled between the arms, while the lower body stays flat on brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 are unchanged.",
      "Frame 21: Robotic arm_2 moves slightly farther down and inward, bringing its gripper into close contact with the shirt-and-hanger area near the upper-right chest. Robotic arm_1 stays at the upper-left fabric of green T-shirt_1. White clothes hanger_1 retains its diagonal orientation, with its lower bar crossing just above the printed design and its hook extending above the neckline. Small folds accumulate around the right gripper. Brown comforter_1 and bed_1 remain beneath the flat lower shirt. Light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain stationary.",
      "Frame 22: Both robotic arm_1 and robotic arm_2 remain close to opposite sides of green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper section, with very little visible displacement from the preceding frame. White clothes hanger_1 remains exposed between them, its hook at the upper-left and its lower bar spanning the chest above the graphic. The shirt\u2019s neckline stays raised and wrinkled, while its body and right sleeve remain supported by brown comforter_1 on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 is still visible along the right mattress edge. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain untouched at the head of the bed.",
      "Frame 23: Robotic arm_2 begins moving upward and slightly right, while robotic arm_1 shifts outward toward the left. White clothes hanger_1 tilts upward with the changing position of the shirt\u2019s upper fabric, and its lower bar moves higher relative to the printed graphic. Green T-shirt_1 develops a raised fold across the collar and shoulder line, though most of its torso remains on brown comforter_1. Bed_1 and light-colored bedsheet_1 stay fixed. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain in the background without visible movement or contact.",
      "Frame 24: The two grippers separate laterally: robotic arm_1 moves left while robotic arm_2 stays farther right and slightly elevated. The upper portion of green T-shirt_1 rises between them, and white clothes hanger_1 rotates to a shallower diagonal across the lifted fabric. Its hook remains visible at the upper-left, while its lower bar is increasingly bordered by green folds. The shirt\u2019s lower body and graphic still lie on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains exposed at right. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 retain their arrangement.",
      "Frame 25: Robotic arm_1 moves farther left, stretching the shirt\u2019s upper-left section outward, while robotic arm_2 maintains close contact near the upper-right edge. Green T-shirt_1\u2019s collar and upper chest form a broader elevated panel between the arms. White clothes hanger_1 sits along that lifted area, with its hook above the left side and part of its lower outline disappearing behind fabric folds. Brown comforter_1 remains visible around the shirt on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 stays along the right side, and striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain still.",
      "Frame 26: Robotic arm_1 and robotic arm_2 hold widely separated positions on either side of green T-shirt_1\u2019s upper section. The shirt rises more prominently between the grippers, producing vertical and diagonal folds descending toward the printed chest graphic. White clothes hanger_1 is partly obscured by this raised fabric; its hook and upper sloping outline remain visible above the neckline. The shirt\u2019s lower torso remains against brown comforter_1 on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains uncovered at right. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 show no displacement.",
      "Frame 27: The upper fabric of green T-shirt_1 remains elevated between robotic arm_1 on the left and robotic arm_2 on the right. Small gripper adjustments alter the folds near the neckline, but the arms remain farther apart than earlier. White clothes hanger_1\u2019s hook is visible above the left-central collar region, while much of its lower triangular body is hidden behind the raised shirt. The graphic remains readable below the folds, resting over brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain unchanged.",
      "Frame 28: Robotic arm_2 rotates and moves inward toward the center of green T-shirt_1\u2019s neckline, reducing the distance between its gripper and robotic arm_1. The raised upper fabric slackens into deeper folds around the middle. White clothes hanger_1 shifts slightly, with its hook still protruding above the left side and only a short section of its lower structure visible. The shirt\u2019s torso remains on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 stays at right, while striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain stationary beyond the manipulation area.",
      "Frame 29: Robotic arm_2 advances farther left and slightly upward, placing its gripper close to the central collar area of green T-shirt_1. Robotic arm_1 remains beside the raised left shoulder fabric. White clothes hanger_1\u2019s hook becomes more upright above the collar, while its triangular body is mostly obscured by green fabric and the grippers. The shirt gathers into a central ridge above the pale graphic, with the lower portion still supported by brown comforter_1. Bed_1, light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 retain their positions.",
      "Frame 30: Robotic arm_1 shifts slightly inward as robotic arm_2 remains near the center-right neckline of green T-shirt_1, bringing the end effectors closer together. The shirt\u2019s upper section bunches between them, and the collar opening is partly concealed by overlapping folds. White clothes hanger_1 remains at the neckline; its hook and a short sloping white segment are visible, but the lower bar is hidden. The shirt\u2019s lower body continues lying on brown comforter_1 atop bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain undisturbed.",
      "Frame 31: Robotic arm_1 holds close to green T-shirt_1\u2019s gathered upper-left fabric, while robotic arm_2 makes a small inward adjustment near the upper-center collar. White clothes hanger_1\u2019s hook protrudes above the fabric between the arms, and a short diagonal section remains visible below it; most of the hanger is occluded. The shirt\u2019s upper chest is raised and wrinkled, with its printed torso still spread over brown comforter_1 on bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1 remains exposed on the right. Striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain fixed at the head of the bed.",
      "Frame 32: Robotic arm_1 and robotic arm_2 remain close to opposite sides of the bunched neckline of green T-shirt_1, with only a small positional change from the preceding frame. The upper-left fabric is raised near the left gripper, and the right gripper is close to the upper-center folds. White clothes hanger_1\u2019s hook and a short sloping section remain visible above and against the green fabric, while the rest is largely obscured. The lower shirt stays on brown comforter_1 covering bed_1. Light-colored bedsheet_1, striped pillow_1, gray pillow_1, and pile of clothing_1 remain unchanged."
