      "Frame 30: Cutting_board_1 remains shifted left beside waste_bin_1, but cucumber_peelings_1 are no longer visibly spread on its surface. Robotic_arm_1 holds bench_scraper_1 over the board's upper-left-to-middle area, with its blade just above or against the wood. Robotic_arm_2 remains in contact near the board's right edge. The board shows pale and damp-looking streaks rather than the earlier pile of strips. Vegetable_peeler_1 lies unchanged on countertop_1 below the board, and cucumber_1 remains inside red_bowl_1 at the right. Background_workbench_1 and electrical_cables_1 remain visible behind the arms.",
