      "Frame 28: robotic_arm_1_left advances robotic_gripper_1_left slightly right. robotic_arm_2_right lifts and reorients robotic_gripper_2_right, raising its projecting upper jaw and the adjacent right side of the tie. The upper-right free portion of zip_tie_1_orange_held_between_grippers stands more clearly apart from the headed left side, while the U-shaped bottom remains above zip_tie_bundle_1_orange_in_tray. The tips are close horizontally but vertically separated. tray_1_transparent and work_surface_1 remain stationary. camera_1_foreground and camera_stand_1 remain unchanged in the foreground.",
      "Frame 29: robotic_arm_1_left retracts robotic_gripper_1_left substantially left relative to the previous frame. robotic_arm_2_right holds robotic_gripper_2_right near its preceding position with a slight downward adjustment. zip_tie_1_orange_held_between_grippers spreads into a noticeably wider U: its headed left side moves left, while its free upper-right segment leans up-left from the right jaw area. The bottom hangs a short apparent distance above zip_tie_bundle_1_orange_in_tray. tray_1_transparent and work_surface_1 remain fixed. camera_1_foreground and camera_stand_1 remain motionless.",
      "Frame 30: robotic_arm_1_left moves robotic_gripper_1_left back right, decreasing the horizontal gap to the right gripper. robotic_arm_2_right shifts robotic_gripper_2_right slightly right and down. zip_tie_1_orange_held_between_grippers narrows from the previous frame, its headed left side moving inward while its free upper-right portion remains visibly separate. The lower curve descends close to the top of zip_tie_bundle_1_orange_in_tray in projection. The bundle stays undisturbed in tray_1_transparent on work_surface_1. camera_1_foreground and camera_stand_1 remain fixed.",
      "Frame 31: robotic_arm_1_left advances robotic_gripper_1_left a little farther right. robotic_arm_2_right lowers robotic_gripper_2_right slightly, preserving the visible gap between its upper and lower jaw surfaces. zip_tie_1_orange_held_between_grippers hangs in a moderately broad U, with the head above the left tip and the free upper-right segment leaning diagonally up-left. Its bottom is nearly coincident with the bundle's top edge in image space. zip_tie_bundle_1_orange_in_tray, tray_1_transparent, and work_surface_1 remain stationary. camera_1_foreground and camera_stand_1 retain their fixed positions.",
      "Frame 32: robotic_arm_1_left retracts robotic_gripper_1_left slightly left from the preceding frame. robotic_arm_2_right and robotic_gripper_2_right remain almost unchanged, with the right jaws pointing left and somewhat downward. zip_tie_1_orange_held_between_grippers widens slightly, its headed side moving left while its right side stays beside the right jaws. The U-shaped bottom remains immediately above or visually overlapping zip_tie_bundle_1_orange_in_tray; physical contact is unresolved. The bundle remains in tray_1_transparent on work_surface_1. camera_1_foreground and camera_stand_1 remain stationary, partially obscuring the right assembly."
