      "Frame 26: Robot_arm_1 lowers its triangular gripper behind and just above robot_arm_2's wrist in the area occupied by book_5. Robot_arm_2 remains extended across the center, with its blue-padded fingers close to the green book, whose cover is mostly occluded. The two grippers are very close to one another, with no visible book displacement that can be confirmed through the occlusion. Book_3 remains atop book_2 at the upper left; book_4 remains atop book_1 at the lower right. Board_1, partial book_6, the marked tabletop, and black backdrop remain stationary.",
